program: WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 1.
##
## program -> top_list . EOF [ # ]
## top_list -> top_list . top_item [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## top_list
##

トップレベルに置けるのは、グローバル変数の宣言・関数のプロトタイプ宣言・関数定義・struct 定義だけ。'int' 'char' 'void' 'struct' のどれかで始まるか、ファイルの終わりが来るはず。

program: KW_STRUCT WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 3.
##
## top_item -> KW_STRUCT . IDENT LBRACE field_list RBRACE SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## top_item -> KW_STRUCT . IDENT SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## type_base -> KW_STRUCT . IDENT [ STAR IDENT ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## KW_STRUCT
##

'struct' の後には struct のタグ名（識別子）が来るはず。

program: KW_STRUCT IDENT WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 4.
##
## top_item -> KW_STRUCT IDENT . LBRACE field_list RBRACE SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## top_item -> KW_STRUCT IDENT . SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## type_base -> KW_STRUCT IDENT . [ STAR IDENT ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## KW_STRUCT IDENT
##

'struct タグ名' の後は、struct 定義なら '{'、前方宣言なら ';'、struct 型の宣言なら '*' か宣言する名前が来るはず。

program: KW_STRUCT IDENT LBRACE WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 6.
##
## top_item -> KW_STRUCT IDENT LBRACE . field_list RBRACE SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## KW_STRUCT IDENT LBRACE
##

struct の '{' の後にはフィールドの宣言が来るはず。フィールドは 1 個以上必要で、'int' 'char' 'void' 'struct' のどれかで始まる型名から書く。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN KW_STRUCT WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 7.
##
## type_base -> KW_STRUCT . IDENT [ STAR RPAREN IDENT ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## KW_STRUCT
##

仮引数の型に書いた 'struct' の後には、struct のタグ名（識別子）が来るはず。

program: KW_CHAR WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 12.
##
## decl_type -> type_base ptrs . [ RPAREN IDENT ]
## ptrs -> ptrs . STAR [ STAR RPAREN IDENT ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## type_base ptrs
##

型名の後には、宣言する名前（識別子）か、ポインタにする '*' が来るはず。

program: KW_STRUCT IDENT LBRACE KW_CHAR IDENT SEMI WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 14.
##
## field_list -> field_list . field [ RBRACE KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR ]
## top_item -> KW_STRUCT IDENT LBRACE field_list . RBRACE SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## KW_STRUCT IDENT LBRACE field_list
##

struct の中では、続けてフィールドを宣言するか（'int' 'char' 'void' 'struct' で始まる）、'}' で struct を閉じるはず。

program: KW_STRUCT IDENT LBRACE KW_CHAR IDENT SEMI RBRACE WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 15.
##
## top_item -> KW_STRUCT IDENT LBRACE field_list RBRACE . SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## KW_STRUCT IDENT LBRACE field_list RBRACE
##

struct 定義を閉じた '}' の後には ';' が必要。

program: KW_STRUCT IDENT LBRACE KW_CHAR RPAREN
##
## Ends in an error in state: 18.
##
## field -> decl_type . IDENT SEMI [ RBRACE KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## decl_type
##
## WARNING: This example involves spurious reductions.
## This implies that, although the LR(1) items shown above provide an
## accurate view of the past (what has been recognized so far), they
## may provide an INCOMPLETE view of the future (what was expected next).
## In state 12, spurious reduction of production decl_type -> type_base ptrs
##

struct フィールドの型名の後には、フィールド名（識別子）か、ポインタにする '*' が来るはず。

program: KW_STRUCT IDENT LBRACE KW_CHAR IDENT WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 19.
##
## field -> decl_type IDENT . SEMI [ RBRACE KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## decl_type IDENT
##

struct フィールドの宣言は ';' で終わるはず。

program: KW_CHAR RPAREN
##
## Ends in an error in state: 24.
##
## top_item -> decl_type . IDENT LPAREN param_clause RPAREN SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## top_item -> decl_type . IDENT LPAREN param_clause RPAREN func_body [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## top_item -> decl_type . IDENT SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## decl_type
##
## WARNING: This example involves spurious reductions.
## This implies that, although the LR(1) items shown above provide an
## accurate view of the past (what has been recognized so far), they
## may provide an INCOMPLETE view of the future (what was expected next).
## In state 12, spurious reduction of production decl_type -> type_base ptrs
##

型名の後には、宣言する名前（識別子）か、ポインタにする '*' が来るはず。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 25.
##
## top_item -> decl_type IDENT . LPAREN param_clause RPAREN SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## top_item -> decl_type IDENT . LPAREN param_clause RPAREN func_body [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## top_item -> decl_type IDENT . SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## decl_type IDENT
##

宣言した名前の後は、グローバル変数の宣言なら ';'、関数のプロトタイプ宣言・関数定義なら 仮引数を書き始める '(' が来るはず。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 27.
##
## top_item -> decl_type IDENT LPAREN . param_clause RPAREN SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## top_item -> decl_type IDENT LPAREN . param_clause RPAREN func_body [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## decl_type IDENT LPAREN
##

仮引数並びの '(' の後には、仮引数の型名（'int' 'char' 'void' 'struct' で始まる）か、引数なしを表す ')' が来るはず。引数なしは '(void)' ではなく '()' と書く。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN KW_CHAR IDENT WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 29.
##
## param_clause -> param_list . [ RPAREN ]
## param_clause -> param_list . COMMA ELLIPSIS [ RPAREN ]
## param_list -> param_list . COMMA parameter [ RPAREN COMMA ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## param_list
##

仮引数の後は、次の仮引数を続ける ',' か、仮引数並びを閉じる ')' が来るはず。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN KW_CHAR IDENT COMMA WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 30.
##
## param_clause -> param_list COMMA . ELLIPSIS [ RPAREN ]
## param_list -> param_list COMMA . parameter [ RPAREN COMMA ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## param_list COMMA
##

仮引数並びの ',' の後には、次の仮引数の型名か、可変長引数を表す '...' が来るはず。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN KW_CHAR RPAREN
##
## Ends in an error in state: 33.
##
## parameter -> decl_type . IDENT [ RPAREN COMMA ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## decl_type
##
## WARNING: This example involves spurious reductions.
## This implies that, although the LR(1) items shown above provide an
## accurate view of the past (what has been recognized so far), they
## may provide an INCOMPLETE view of the future (what was expected next).
## In state 12, spurious reduction of production decl_type -> type_base ptrs
##

仮引数は型名の後に名前（識別子）が必須。'*' でポインタにしてから名前を書いてもよい。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN KW_CHAR IDENT COMMA ELLIPSIS WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 35.
##
## top_item -> decl_type IDENT LPAREN param_clause . RPAREN SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## top_item -> decl_type IDENT LPAREN param_clause . RPAREN func_body [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## decl_type IDENT LPAREN param_clause
##

可変長引数の '...' は仮引数並びの最後にしか置けない。次は ')' が来るはず。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 36.
##
## top_item -> decl_type IDENT LPAREN param_clause RPAREN . SEMI [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## top_item -> decl_type IDENT LPAREN param_clause RPAREN . func_body [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## decl_type IDENT LPAREN param_clause RPAREN
##

仮引数並びを閉じた ')' の後は、プロトタイプ宣言なら ';'、関数定義なら本体を開く '{' が来るはず。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE SLASH
##
## Ends in an error in state: 39.
##
## func_body -> LBRACE local_decls . stmt_list RBRACE [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## local_decls -> local_decls . local_decl [ WHILE STR STAR SIZEOF SEMI RETURN RBRACE PLUSPLUS NUM MINUSMINUS MINUS LPAREN LBRACE KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR IF IDENT FOR CONTINUE CHAR_LIT BREAK BANG AMP ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## LBRACE local_decls
##

関数本体の中には、局所変数の宣言（'int' 'char' 'void' 'struct' で始まる）か、文（式文・';'・'{ ... }' のブロック・if・while・for・return・break・continue のいずれか）か、本体を閉じる '}' が来るはず。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE SEMI SLASH
##
## Ends in an error in state: 40.
##
## func_body -> LBRACE local_decls stmt_list . RBRACE [ KW_VOID KW_STRUCT KW_INT KW_CHAR EOF ]
## stmt_list -> stmt_list . stmt [ WHILE STR STAR SIZEOF SEMI RETURN RBRACE PLUSPLUS NUM MINUSMINUS MINUS LPAREN LBRACE IF IDENT FOR CONTINUE CHAR_LIT BREAK BANG AMP ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## LBRACE local_decls stmt_list
##

ここには文（式文・';'・'{ ... }' のブロック・if・while・for・return・break・continue のいずれか）か、関数本体を閉じる '}' が来るはず。局所変数の宣言は関数本体の先頭にしか置けないので、文を書き始めた後には宣言を置けない。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE WHILE WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 41.
##
## stmt -> WHILE . LPAREN expr RPAREN stmt [ WHILE STR STAR SIZEOF SEMI RETURN RBRACE PLUSPLUS NUM MINUSMINUS MINUS LPAREN LBRACE IF IDENT FOR ELSE CONTINUE CHAR_LIT BREAK BANG AMP ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## WHILE
##

'while' の後には条件を囲む '(' が来るはず。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE WHILE LPAREN WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 42.
##
## stmt -> WHILE LPAREN . expr RPAREN stmt [ WHILE STR STAR SIZEOF SEMI RETURN RBRACE PLUSPLUS NUM MINUSMINUS MINUS LPAREN LBRACE IF IDENT FOR ELSE CONTINUE CHAR_LIT BREAK BANG AMP ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## WHILE LPAREN
##

'while' の条件が書かれていない。ここには式が来るはず（数値・文字リテラル・文字列リテラル・変数名・関数呼び出し・'(' で始まる括弧式・単項の '-' '!' '*' '&' '++' '--'・sizeof(型) のいずれか）。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE STAR WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 44.
##
## unary -> STAR . unary [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE GT GE EQEQ COMMA COLON ASSIGN ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## STAR
##

単項の '*'（ポインタの参照外し）には演算対象が要る。ここには式が来るはず（数値・文字リテラル・文字列リテラル・変数名・関数呼び出し・'(' で始まる括弧式・単項の '-' '!' '*' '&' '++' '--'・sizeof(型) のいずれか）。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE SIZEOF WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 45.
##
## unary -> SIZEOF . LPAREN sizeof_type RPAREN [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE GT GE EQEQ COMMA COLON ASSIGN ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## SIZEOF
##

'sizeof' の後には型名を囲む '(' が来るはず。この言語の sizeof は 'sizeof(型)' の形だけで、'sizeof 式' は書けない。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE SIZEOF LPAREN WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 46.
##
## unary -> SIZEOF LPAREN . sizeof_type RPAREN [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE GT GE EQEQ COMMA COLON ASSIGN ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## SIZEOF LPAREN
##

'sizeof(' の後には型名が来るはず（'int' 'char' 'void' 'struct タグ名' のいずれか、後ろに '*' を付けてもよい）。'sizeof(変数)' のように式を書くことはできない。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE SIZEOF LPAREN KW_CHAR IDENT
##
## Ends in an error in state: 47.
##
## unary -> SIZEOF LPAREN sizeof_type . RPAREN [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE GT GE EQEQ COMMA COLON ASSIGN ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## SIZEOF LPAREN sizeof_type
##
## WARNING: This example involves spurious reductions.
## This implies that, although the LR(1) items shown above provide an
## accurate view of the past (what has been recognized so far), they
## may provide an INCOMPLETE view of the future (what was expected next).
## In state 12, spurious reduction of production decl_type -> type_base ptrs
## In state 49, spurious reduction of production sizeof_type -> decl_type
##

'sizeof' の型名の後は、ポインタにする '*' を続けるか、')' で閉じるはず。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE PLUSPLUS WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 50.
##
## unary -> PLUSPLUS . unary [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE GT GE EQEQ COMMA COLON ASSIGN ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## PLUSPLUS
##

前置の '++' には演算対象が要る。ここには式が来るはず（数値・文字リテラル・文字列リテラル・変数名・関数呼び出し・'(' で始まる括弧式・単項の '-' '!' '*' '&' '++' '--'・sizeof(型) のいずれか）。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE MINUSMINUS WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 52.
##
## unary -> MINUSMINUS . unary [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE GT GE EQEQ COMMA COLON ASSIGN ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## MINUSMINUS
##

前置の '--' には演算対象が要る。ここには式が来るはず（数値・文字リテラル・文字列リテラル・変数名・関数呼び出し・'(' で始まる括弧式・単項の '-' '!' '*' '&' '++' '--'・sizeof(型) のいずれか）。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE MINUS WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 53.
##
## unary -> MINUS . unary [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE GT GE EQEQ COMMA COLON ASSIGN ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## MINUS
##

単項の '-'（符号反転）には演算対象が要る。ここには式が来るはず（数値・文字リテラル・文字列リテラル・変数名・関数呼び出し・'(' で始まる括弧式・単項の '-' '!' '*' '&' '++' '--'・sizeof(型) のいずれか）。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE LPAREN WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 54.
##
## primary -> LPAREN . expr RPAREN [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE LBRACKET GT GE EQEQ DOT COMMA COLON ASSIGN ARROW ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## LPAREN
##

'(' で始めた括弧の中身が書かれていない。ここには式が来るはず（数値・文字リテラル・文字列リテラル・変数名・関数呼び出し・'(' で始まる括弧式・単項の '-' '!' '*' '&' '++' '--'・sizeof(型) のいずれか）。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE IDENT WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 55.
##
## primary -> IDENT . [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE LBRACKET GT GE EQEQ DOT COMMA COLON ASSIGN ARROW ANDAND ]
## primary -> IDENT . LPAREN arg_list_opt RPAREN [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE LBRACKET GT GE EQEQ DOT COMMA COLON ASSIGN ARROW ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## IDENT
##

識別子の後に置けないトークンが来ている。関数呼び出しの '('、配列の添字の '['、メンバ参照の '.' '->'、演算子（'+' '-' '*' '/' '%' '<' '>' '<=' '>=' '==' '!=' '&&' '||' '?' '='）、または今書いている式を終える区切り（文の終わりなら ';'、括弧の中なら ')'、添字なら ']'、引数なら ','）が来るはず。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE IDENT LPAREN WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 56.
##
## primary -> IDENT LPAREN . arg_list_opt RPAREN [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE LBRACKET GT GE EQEQ DOT COMMA COLON ASSIGN ARROW ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## IDENT LPAREN
##

関数呼び出しの '(' の後には、引数の式か、引数なしを表す ')' が来るはず。引数は式（数値・文字リテラル・文字列リテラル・変数名・関数呼び出し・'(' で始まる括弧式・単項の '-' '!' '*' '&' '++' '--'・sizeof(型) のいずれか）。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE BANG WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 58.
##
## unary -> BANG . unary [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE GT GE EQEQ COMMA COLON ASSIGN ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## BANG
##

単項の '!'（論理否定）には演算対象が要る。ここには式が来るはず（数値・文字リテラル・文字列リテラル・変数名・関数呼び出し・'(' で始まる括弧式・単項の '-' '!' '*' '&' '++' '--'・sizeof(型) のいずれか）。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE AMP WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 59.
##
## unary -> AMP . unary [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE GT GE EQEQ COMMA COLON ASSIGN ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## AMP
##

単項の '&'（アドレス取得）には演算対象が要る。ここには式が来るはず（数値・文字リテラル・文字列リテラル・変数名・関数呼び出し・'(' で始まる括弧式・単項の '-' '!' '*' '&' '++' '--'・sizeof(型) のいずれか）。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE CHAR_LIT WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 62.
##
## postfix -> postfix . LBRACKET expr RBRACKET [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE LBRACKET GT GE EQEQ DOT COMMA COLON ASSIGN ARROW ANDAND ]
## postfix -> postfix . ARROW IDENT [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE LBRACKET GT GE EQEQ DOT COMMA COLON ASSIGN ARROW ANDAND ]
## postfix -> postfix . DOT IDENT [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE LBRACKET GT GE EQEQ DOT COMMA COLON ASSIGN ARROW ANDAND ]
## unary -> postfix . [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE GT GE EQEQ COMMA COLON ASSIGN ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## postfix
##

式の後に置けないトークンが来ている。配列の添字の '['、メンバ参照の '.' '->'、演算子（'+' '-' '*' '/' '%' '<' '>' '<=' '>=' '==' '!=' '&&' '||' '?' '='）、または今書いている式を終える区切り（文の終わりなら ';'、括弧の中なら ')'、添字なら ']'、引数なら ','）が来るはず。

program: KW_CHAR IDENT LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE CHAR_LIT LBRACKET WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 63.
##
## postfix -> postfix LBRACKET . expr RBRACKET [ STAR SLASH SEMI RPAREN RBRACKET QUESTION PLUS PERCENT OROR NE MINUS LT LE LBRACKET GT GE EQEQ DOT COMMA COLON ASSIGN ARROW ANDAND ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## postfix LBRACKET
##

